      "q": "How much does Salient Crgt make from federal contracts?",
      "a": "Salient Crgt has $1.3B in federal contract obligations in FY2026 to date. Salient Crgt reached that total across 63 awards with an average award size of $20.2M, and obligations are up 55.9% year over year."
