    {
      "q": "Which agencies buy from Salient Crgt?",
      "a": "The General Services Administration and the Department of Veterans Affairs are the largest buyers of Salient Crgt in FY2026 to date. The General Services Administration obligated $718M and the Department of Veterans Affairs obligated $274M, followed by the Department of Homeland Security at $121M and the Department of Housing and Urban Development at $65.4M."
    },
